00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:24.720
and also that the gradient of some constant a&nbsp;
times f is that constant times the gradient of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:32.720
f so this is really important linearity means that&nbsp;
superposition holds if i write down a differential&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:38.480
equation in terms of the gradient operator it's&nbsp;
a linear differential equation and superposition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:44.240
