those solutions there's still a solution when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.200
you add them together so linearity is a really&nbsp;
important property for differential equations and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.000
for operators in general and i just want to point&nbsp;
out that the gradient is in fact a linear operator&nbsp;&nbsp;

